      "id": "claim_a6acc9b85c4d4d06aa6e0a7f4ee7ce36",
      "statement": "Criterion ids are dotted and dimension-first but nothing parses them: the explicit `dimension` field is authoritative for selecting the weighted bucket, not the id prefix.",
