    {
      "id": "claim_1f9c81153f4e4be6983b11961ad3b3c4",
      "statement": "A criterion's weight enters both sides of its dimension ratio — as weight times score in the numerator and weight times scale_max in the denominator — and additionally serves as the descending sort key for the Remediation sheet.",
