      "statement": "The D/H/L tag is descriptive intent rather than a dispatch key: routing to deterministic resolution requires both that the tag is D and that a deterministic score exists for that id, so five of the thirteen D-tagged criteria have no scorer and fall through to LLM judgment despite their tag.",
