      "id": "claim_665390f3b77847c39af2808335cd3e2a",
      "statement": "load_registry enforces one explicit semantic check beyond Pydantic typing — criterion ids must be unique, raising ValueError otherwise — because ids are used as dictionary keys throughout the pipeline, where a duplicate would silently shadow one criterion rather than failing.",
